  "description": "“Let’s make a contract. We will live as a married couple for the next two years.”\n\n1 billion if you get married, 1 billion if you divorce.\n\nIn response to Han-gyeol's offer that she couldn't refuse, Eun-soo agreed to become a contract bride for two years. \"I have a condition. You must not meet anyone else while you are married to me.\"\n\nI decide to go.\n\nHowever, the chairman, a.k.a. grandfather-in-law, suggested we live together in a big house… !! The vice president a.ka cousin and sister-in-law who also moved in with me...!\n\nWhat happens to me now..?!!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60061278), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EA%B3%84%EC%95%BD%EC%A7%81-%EC%8B%A0%EB%B6%80/3010)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/122115)",
